                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On August 13, 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre proudly launched a Customer Care Executive Internship program, offering an exciting opportunity for 18 young individuals to gain work experience and earn an income. This initiative is designed to provide hands-on experience in office environments, specifically focusing on customer care, helping participants understand the responsibilities and dynamics of professional workplaces.
                                    One of the core objectives of this internship is to empower youth, especially young girls and women, by providing them with the skills and confidence to achieve financial independence. By taking part in this program, participants not only learn about customer service operations but also develop the practical knowledge necessary to thrive in office settings.
                                    Skillbook remains dedicated to societal and student welfare, and this internship program is a step towards enabling the community to grow through education and practical work opportunities. The initiative is a reflection of Skillbook's commitment to uplifting individuals and fostering a path to self-reliance.
                                    Through this internship, Skillbook continues to provide platforms for youth to enhance their careers, preparing them for the challenges of the professional world while promoting financial freedom and self-sufficiency.                                    
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
